        "does": "The knob on top behind the cab (the hand-of-god gear) steers the loader by bending it in the middle: its upright shaft's lower 12-tooth bevel gear turns a long shaft running forward, whose 12-tooth gear turns the 60-tooth turntable joining the front half (arm and front wheels) to the rear half (engine and rear wheels).",
